## Interface: 110007
## Title: Hermes — WoW! Expert Game Master
## Notes: An AI-style Game Master coach for World of Warcraft. Mirrors the wow! expert backend: modular feature registry, a "Game Master" reasoning engine that explains WHY a recommendation is optimal, plus rotation, cooldown, boss/affix, quest, and collection advisors. Pairs with the wow! expert companion service (optional).
## Author: wow! expert team
## Version: 0.1.0
## SavedVariables: HermesDB
## DefaultState: enabled
## LoadOnDemand: 0
